  0  gate act. -exp(A_log)*softplus(g+dt)    0.00    768.0      0.0  elementwise
  1  g_cum = cumsum(g) over chunk           0.00    512.0      0.0  scan
  4  w = M (Gamma . K)                      8.59    256.0     32.0  matmul
  5  u = M V                                8.59    256.0     32.0  matmul
